{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act15d0_level_act15d0_07_beg",
  "groupId": "act15d0",
  "stageId": "act15d0_07",
  "title": "背叛",
  "storyCode": "MB-7",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act15d0/level_act15d0_07_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "b98848b9503bcb202c7d0a8e0afe4b914b5119a541ef5d7a78cbf9cd6e9faa6d",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "text": "啊，這下終於到實行越獄的環節了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "text": "感覺整個流程雖然略過了一些事情，但還是比我想像的要複雜許多呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "text": "呼啊，我都有些睏了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "我也有一點。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "啊，我去給大家泡一杯咖啡吧~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "text": "還差一點就結束了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "text": "我知道我知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "text": "不過接下來發生的事我也差不多猜到啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "text": "一切準備就緒，只等實行越獄的那一天到來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "text": "但是在實行的那一天，有一個人卻忽然失蹤了，對吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "text": "是的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "text": "他們最終決定在監獄停靠在紐萊堡市期間的某一次進入C區清掃的機會進行越獄。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "text": "但是在那一天約定的時間，羅賓卻沒有出現。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "text": "因為他們不知道，他們的計畫早已被在暗處的傑斯頓完全掌握了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "text": "而羅賓，早已經在他們的必經之路上等待著他們——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "雖然場面有點混亂，但是姑且跟你確認一下我們的計畫！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "我們像現在這樣，趁打掃囚房的機會進來配合你放倒囚犯和獄警......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "然後我們兩個趁著監控那邊的獄警還沒來得及反應，直接前往頂層啟動塔的下沉，然後讓監獄斷電。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "杜瑪已經在地下等著了，只要和她會合，然後一起進入早就挖好的地道裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "最後換上米娜幫我們偷來的工作人員的服裝出去就行了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "我一直很懷疑，真的有適合我體格的工作人員服裝嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "放心放心，杜瑪特意幫你重新縫製過了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "一件不夠那就用兩件拼起來嘛，看起來超大的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "記得感謝她哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "當然。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "獄警",
      "text": "唔！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "再！見！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "你似乎很興奮，卡夫卡小姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "嘿嘿，越獄這麼好玩的事情，我當然要興奮了!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "不過......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "對了，怎麼沒看到羅賓小姐？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "獄警A",
      "text": "這次清掃的都是老面孔，就不用我多說了吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "是~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯A",
      "text": "長官，要是我們之中又有要刺殺安東尼老大的怎麼辦啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "獄警A",
      "text": "你傻的啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "獄警A",
      "text": "你以為剛才的搜身是幹嘛的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "獄警A",
      "text": "我就不信你們空著手能幹得過安東尼先生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B區囚犯A",
      "text": "嘿嘿，我看你很想和安東尼先生過過招啊，要打的話喊我一聲，我來給你助助威。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯A",
      "text": "滾，沒跟你說話。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "（怎麼回事，羅賓怎麼沒來？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "喂，A區的大哥，羅賓人呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯B",
      "text": "B區的別跟我說話......哦，是卡夫卡啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯B",
      "text": "不知道啊，剛才就沒找到她，我就是頂替她來的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "獄警B",
      "text": "行了，少廢話。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "獄警B",
      "text": "A區的跟他，B區的跟我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "嘖，沒有時間了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "羅賓，抱歉了啊，要怪只能怪你自己這麼緊要的關頭不在了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "......事到如今，也沒有回頭的路了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "以後還能遇到她的話再向她道歉吧，走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "這裡就是主控室了啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "嗚哇，灰塵好多！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "當心！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "誒？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "羅賓？！為什麼你會在這裡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "我有備份的卡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "備份？你什麼時候......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B區囚犯A",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B區囚犯B",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "退後。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "......我們趕時間，現在沒有說話的時間。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "速戰速決吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
